rap" data-icon="gpicon-icon" data-id="1629018999118" data-ver="1.0"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><div class="gf_icon-wrap" style="color: rgb(152, 178, 128);"><i class="gf_icon fa fa-circle"></i></div></div></div></div></li><li class="item" style="width: 20px;"><div data-index="7" data-key="content" class="item-content"><div data-label="Icon" id="e-1629018999147" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-icon" data-id="1629018999147" data-ver="1.0"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><div class="gf_icon-wrap" style="color: rgb(152, 178, 128);"><i class="gf_icon fa fa-circle"></i></div></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1629018999116" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1629018999116"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>今日から簡単に始められるサステナブルな活動を提案するコーナーです。</p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;">まずは１週間、私たちと一緒に活動してみませんか？</span><br></p><p><br></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"></span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">今週は➡</span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-size: 22px;"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"></span><strong><span style="font-size: 22px;"></span></strong></span><strong style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 22px;">　　　　　～</span></strong><strong style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 22px;">普段車で行くところに自転車で行きましょう</span></strong><strong style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 22px;">～</span></strong></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center;"><strong style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 22px;"><br></span></strong></p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1629622686575" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1629622686575"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left" data-gemlang="en"><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><font face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif">先週東京オリンピックが開幕し、この4連休はテレビの前でオリンピック漬けだった方も多いのではないでしょうか？</font></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><font face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><font face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif">今週のkapok action「</font>普段車で行くところに自転車で行きましょう<font face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif">」は体の健康にも、地球にも優しいactionです。</font></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><br></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;">日本のCO2年間排出量の約16％が自動車から排出されていると言われております。近年EV社の増加や、経済産業省から発表された2050年に自動車の製造から廃棄・リサイクルまでのライフサイクル全体で二酸化炭素（CO2）排出ゼロをめざすという方針など自動車から排出されるCO2削減に動きが出てきています。</p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><br></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">オリンピックを見てうずうずした体を自転車にのって解消し、これを期に自身の健康と車でのCO2排出について見直してみませんか？</span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: inherit!important;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><br></span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: inherit!important;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">KAPOK KNOTのInstagramでもメンバーのチャレンジを発信していきます 。</span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: inherit!important;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/kapok_knot_jp/" style="max-width: 100%; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration-line: underline; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;" aria-describedby="a11y-external-message"><strong>@kapok_knot_jp</strong></a>をタグ付けして<strong>#kapokaction</strong>で是非SNSに投稿お願いいたします！</span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: inherit!important;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><br></span></span></p></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1629018999160" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629018999160" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/52629108-3f9d-4a6e-aefe-f240d7f4b72a/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/%E2%91%A1.jpeg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" width="3000" height="2250" natural-width="3000" natural-height="2250"></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1629018999134" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1629018999134"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1628601062311" data-id="1628601062311"><div data-label="Social Share" data-key="social-share" id="m-1629018999077" class="module-wrap" data-icon="eicon-social-icons" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629018999077"><div class="module gf_module-center gf_module-center-lg gf_module--md gf_module--sm gf_module--xs " data-modelink="auto" data-editlink="" data-btnlabel="none" data-sharein=""><a href="#" title="facebook" data-sharetext="Share" data-sharein="popup" class="gf_social gf_social-facebook" style="width: ; height: ; font-size: 14px; margin-right: 5px; background: #3B5998ff"><i class="fa fa-facebook" aria-hidden="true" style="color: #ffffffff;"></i></a><a href="#" title="twitter" data-sharetext="Tweet" data-sharein="popup" class="gf_social gf_social-twitter" style="width: ; height: ; font-size: 14px; margin-right: 5px; background: #55a